                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a56c61e-13d5-40d4-afe4-6570b164713a",
                        "source_entry_id": "36f57d47-3aba-3e12-aefc-5788b749cfc3",
                        "source_sense_id": "8f7f2800-08ef-3533-b938-9fc7769ac45f",
                        "source_sense_description": "bij de huizen aanbellen om rotzooi te verkopen",
                        "target_lang_word": "peddle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "peddle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed2b8bf1-2583-39f7-8448-5d1c778235a2",
                                        "entry_id": "d4c2fbae-0072-33b1-b67a-10454a769938",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell things, especially door to door or in insignificant quantities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "540660f3-b2a1-418a-94e9-53c1e97f4d4d",
                                                "sense_id": "ed2b8bf1-2583-39f7-8448-5d1c778235a2",
                                                "text": "My hopes wa'n't disappointed. I never saw clams thicker than they was along them inshore flats. I filled my dreener in no time, and then it come to me that 'twouldn't be a bad idee to get a lot more, take 'em with me to Wellmouth, and peddle 'em out. Clams was fairly scarce over that side of the bay and ought to fetch a fair price."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb924d95-fcf0-396f-9cd1-f28432b8caf2",
                                        "entry_id": "d4c2fbae-0072-33b1-b67a-10454a769938",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell illegal narcotics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a97448f-cfaf-4a4f-a358-68e398cbe4c8",
                                                "sense_id": "eb924d95-fcf0-396f-9cd1-f28432b8caf2",
                                                "text": "- How much you think this stuff is worth?\n- Yeah, there must be a million bucks' worth.\n- Think we could peddle it?\n- Oh, you can always get rid of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46d6ad09-8ad4-3ab0-adcd-21f6d55dda2b",
                                        "entry_id": "d4c2fbae-0072-33b1-b67a-10454a769938",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spread or cause to spread."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22cae272-52e7-4d34-93e0-39cbe8d38381",
                                                "sense_id": "46d6ad09-8ad4-3ab0-adcd-21f6d55dda2b",
                                                "text": "Christine walked a dangerous line, peddling gossip about her detested son-in-law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b1bdf6d-06eb-4bcd-b4a9-52fe374190bb",
                                                "sense_id": "46d6ad09-8ad4-3ab0-adcd-21f6d55dda2b",
                                                "text": "Roberts was a drug dealer, nicknamed 'King Krud', who peddled death and misery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "becb7c0f-d54d-434c-ae91-f7966a39a466",
                                                "sense_id": "46d6ad09-8ad4-3ab0-adcd-21f6d55dda2b",
                                                "text": "Yes, there were instances of grandstanding and obsessive behaviour, but many were concealed at the time to help protect an aggressively peddled narrative of [Oscar] Pistorius the paragon, the emblem, the trailblazer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9543c865-0073-405b-aa8d-7577e8a9da3d",
                                                "sense_id": "46d6ad09-8ad4-3ab0-adcd-21f6d55dda2b",
                                                "text": "As for the IRP, Secretary of State Grant Shapps continues to peddle snake oil, smoke and mirrors. His reaction to near-universal IRP condemnation from politicians, local and national media, and all but a few rail specialists was to dismiss the lot of us (in the condescending and patronising tone we have now come to expect) as \"critics and naysayers\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
